"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">18</div><h1>동사의 목적어 — 3격 동사·전치사 동사·비인칭 es</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Verben mit Dativ, Verben mit Präpositionen, das unpersönliche „es“</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 18의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 17 · 중간 9 · 도전 6 · 보강 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">helfen·gefallen 같은 3격 동사와 3격·4격 동사를 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">동사마다 정해진 전치사와 그 격을 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">사람은 전치사 + 대명사, 사물은 da(r)-·wo(r)-로 받고 물어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">비인칭 es와 Mir ist kalt 같은 3격 표현을 바르게 써요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"0c0e678633\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich helfe <span class=\"qblank\"></span> beim Umzug. (너를)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) dich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) du</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) dein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) dir</button></div><div class=\"qe\">helfen은 3격 동사예요. 한국어로 '너를'이어도 du의 3격 dir를 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"07492e02d8\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;uns&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Der Fisch schmeckt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wir)</span> nicht.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 생선은 우리 입맛에 맞지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Fisch schmeckt <b>uns</b> nicht.</div>schmecken은 사물(der Fisch)이 주어이고 먹는 사람이 3격이에요.<br>wir의 3격은 uns예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"b409e3ba60\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gefällt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Der Ring <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(gefallen)</span> meiner Schwester sehr.</div><div class=\"qko\">언니는 그 반지를 아주 마음에 들어 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Ring <b>gefällt</b> meiner Schwester sehr.</div>주어는 der Ring(단수)이라서 er 형태 gefällt예요(a → ä).<br>meiner Schwester는 3격이라 동사에 영향을 주지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a800556271\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Wir gratulieren <span class=\"qblank\"></span> zur Hochzeit. (너희의 결혼을)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) euch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) euer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) eure</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gratulieren은 3격 동사예요. ihr(너희)의 3격은 euch예요.<br>eure·euer는 소유관사라서 혼자 목적어가 될 수 없어요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9ee613599a\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;meinem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Ich schenke <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(mein · Vater · 남성)</span> Vater eine Uhr.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 아버지께 시계를 선물해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich schenke <b>meinem</b> Vater eine Uhr.</div>schenken은 받는 사람이 3격, 물건이 4격이에요.<br>남성 3격 → meinem Vater.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"894076bc8e\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Die Lehrerin erklärt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(정관사 · die Kinder · 복수)</span> Kindern das Spiel.</div><div class=\"qko\">선생님이 아이들에게 그 놀이를 설명해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Lehrerin erklärt <b>den</b> Kindern das Spiel.</div>erklären은 설명을 듣는 사람이 3격이에요.<br>복수 3격은 den + 명사 -n — den Kindern.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6e4f354ec5\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Wir warten schon lange <span class=\"qblank\"></span> das Paket.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) an</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) für</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) auf</button></div><div class=\"qe\">warten auf + 4격은 '~을 기다리다'예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9fda7f6e51\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Meine Tochter interessiert sich sehr <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Pferde.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) über</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) für</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) an</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) auf</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich interessieren für + 4격은 '~에 관심이 있다'예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"747ece5db4\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;vor&quot;],[&quot;der&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Hast du Angst <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Prüfung · 여성)</span> Prüfung?</div><div class=\"qko\">그 시험이 무서워요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hast du Angst <b>vor</b> <b>der</b> Prüfung?</div>Angst haben vor + 3격이에요.<br>여성 3격 → vor der Prüfung.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"f690b2fc14\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;von&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Ich träume <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> einer Reise nach Island.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 아이슬란드 여행을 꿈꿔요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich träume <b>von</b> einer Reise nach Island.</div>träumen von + 3격은 '~을 꿈꾸다'예요.<br>einer Reise는 여성 3격이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"b0411c045d\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Erinnerst du dich an die Klassenfahrt nach Prag? — Ja, ich erinnere mich gern <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) daran</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) an sie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) an es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) woran</button></div><div class=\"qe\">die Klassenfahrt는 여성이지만 사람이 아니라 일이에요.<br>사물·일은 da(r)- + 전치사로 받아요 — daran.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c95ff41345\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ärgerst du dich? — Über meinen Bruder.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Über wen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Über wem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Über was</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Worüber</button></div><div class=\"qe\">대답이 사람(Bruder)이라서 전치사 + 의문사로 물어요.<br>sich ärgern über는 4격이라 wem이 아니라 wen이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"33e68cfd62\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Worüber&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(über · 사물을 묻는 말)</span> sprecht ihr? — Über das Konzert.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희는 무엇에 대해 이야기해요? — 그 콘서트에 대해서요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Worüber</b> sprecht ihr? — Über das Konzert.</div>사물을 물을 때는 wo(r)- + 전치사예요.<br>über가 모음으로 시작해서 r를 넣어요 — worüber.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c2b5b95e00\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> In unserem Dorf <span class=\"qblank\"></span> keine Apotheke. (약국이 없어요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) gibt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) ist es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) geben es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) gibt es</button></div><div class=\"qe\">존재를 말할 때는 es gibt + 4격이에요.<br>In unserem Dorf가 첫 자리라서 gibt es 순서가 돼요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"776cb1189c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;es&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Im Winter wird <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> hier früh dunkel.</div><div class=\"qko\">겨울에는 여기 일찍 어두워져요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Im Winter wird <b>es</b> hier früh dunkel.</div>날씨·자연을 말할 때는 비인칭 es가 주어예요.<br>Im Winter가 첫 자리에 와도 es는 빠지지 않고 동사 뒤로 가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4a15f6167e\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> '우리 더워요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Wir sind heiß.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Wir haben heiß.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Uns sind heiß.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) Uns ist heiß.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">느끼는 사람을 3격으로 말해요 — uns.<br>주어가 없으니 동사는 ist예요. Wir sind heiß는 전혀 다른 뜻이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"39bc896601\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wonach sucht Ihre Tochter im Keller&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">따님은 지하실에서 무엇을 찾고 있어요?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Ihre</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Tochter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Wonach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">sucht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Keller</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wonach sucht Ihre Tochter im Keller?</b></div>suchen nach + 3격에서 사물을 물으면 wonach예요(nach는 자음으로 시작해서 r 없음).<br>의문사가 첫 자리, 동사 sucht가 둘째 자리예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"cccc2402e6\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihn&quot;],[&quot;dir&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Gibst du mir den Schlüssel? — Ja, ich gebe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(den Schlüssel)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(mir)</span> gleich.</div><div class=\"qko\">열쇠 좀 줄래요? — 네, 바로 줄게요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Gibst du mir den Schlüssel? — Ja, ich gebe <b>ihn</b> <b>dir</b> gleich.</div>den Schlüssel → ihn, mir → (대답에서) dir.<br>대명사끼리는 4격 → 3격 순서예요 — ihn dir.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"810c982fc0\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Ärztin empfiehlt den Patienten einen Spaziergang&quot;,&quot;Den Patienten empfiehlt die Ärztin einen Spaziergang&quot;,&quot;Einen Spaziergang empfiehlt die Ärztin den Patienten&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">의사가 환자들에게 산책을 권해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Spaziergang</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">einen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Ärztin</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Patienten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">empfiehlt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">den</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Ärztin empfiehlt den Patienten einen Spaziergang.</b></div>명사 목적어가 둘이면 3격(den Patienten) → 4격(einen Spaziergang) 순서예요.<br>empfehlen은 er·sie에서 empfiehlt가 돼요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"bda7a043da\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;um&quot;],[&quot;unserer&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Wir kümmern uns <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> den Hund <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(unser · 2격 복수)</span> Nachbarn.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 이웃집 사람들의 개를 돌봐요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir kümmern uns <b>um</b> den Hund <b>unserer</b> Nachbarn.</div>sich kümmern um + 4격은 '~을 돌보다'예요.<br>'우리 이웃들의'는 2격 복수 unserer Nachbarn이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"450b451a5b\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Wir warten <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, dass der Bus kommt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) worauf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) darauf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) dafür</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) auf es</button></div><div class=\"qe\">warten auf 뒤에 명사 대신 문장이 오면 darauf를 놓고 dass 문장으로 이어요.<br>auf es는 쓰지 않고, worauf는 질문할 때 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"75b22480b7\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wonach&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(nach · 사물을 묻는 말)</span> fragt der Polizist? — Nach meinem Ausweis.</div><div class=\"qko\">경찰관이 무엇을 물어요? — 제 신분증이요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wonach</b> fragt der Polizist? — Nach meinem Ausweis.</div>fragen nach + 3격에서 사물을 물으면 wo- + nach예요.<br>nach는 자음으로 시작해서 r 없이 wonach예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"bf158d1134\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Mit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(사람을 묻는 말)</span> telefonierst du so lange? — Mit meiner Oma.</div><div class=\"qko\">누구랑 그렇게 오래 통화해요? — 할머니랑요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mit <b>wem</b> telefonierst du so lange? — Mit meiner Oma.</div>대답이 사람이라서 전치사 + 의문사로 물어요.<br>mit은 3격이라 wer의 3격 wem이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1d46e0f517\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Mathe <span class=\"qblank\"></span> meinem Sohn schwer. (수학이 아들에게 어려워요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) geht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) fallen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) macht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) fällt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">es fällt mir schwer 틀이에요. 주어는 Mathe(단수)라서 fällt예요.<br>meinem Sohn은 3격이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"63f05b4ef7\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Morgen gebe ich es ihr zurück&quot;,&quot;Ich gebe es ihr morgen zurück&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">내일 그녀에게 그걸 돌려줄게요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ihr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">gebe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">es</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">zurück</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Morgen gebe ich es ihr zurück.</b></div>대명사 목적어 둘은 4격(es) → 3격(ihr) 순서예요.<br>분리동사 zurückgeben의 zurück은 맨 끝에 가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9c0dd92326\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Im Bus wird mir oft schlecht&quot;,&quot;Mir wird im Bus oft schlecht&quot;,&quot;Oft wird mir im Bus schlecht&quot;,&quot;Mir wird oft im Bus schlecht&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">버스에서 자주 속이 안 좋아져요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Bus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">oft</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">schlecht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">wird</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">mir</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Im Bus wird mir oft schlecht.</b></div>느끼는 사람은 3격 mir예요. 주어가 따로 없어서 동사는 wird예요.<br>무엇을 첫 자리에 두든 동사는 둘째 자리예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"140429fdba\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Ich habe meiner Freundin nach ihrer Adresse gefragt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Die Kinder folgen dem Lehrer in den Park.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) In der Stadt geben es zwei Kinos.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Hilfst du mich bei den Hausaufgaben?</button></div><div class=\"qe\">folgen은 3격 동사라서 dem Lehrer가 맞아요.<br>fragen은 묻는 상대가 4격이에요 — meine Freundin. helfen은 3격 — dir. es gibt는 늘 gibt예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8170ec447c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;für&quot;],[&quot;mir&quot;],[&quot;an&quot;],[&quot;Geht es&quot;,&quot;Geht&#x27;s&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Hallo Jonas,<br>vielen Dank <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> die Postkarte! Sie gefällt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(ich)</span> sehr. Ich denke jeden Tag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> unsere Zeit in Wien. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(gehen + 비인칭 주어)</span> dir gut?</div><div class=\"qko\">요나스, 엽서 정말 고마워요! 아주 마음에 들어요. 빈에서 보낸 우리 시간을 매일 생각해요. 잘 지내요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hallo Jonas,<br>vielen Dank <b>für</b> die Postkarte! Sie gefällt <b>mir</b> sehr. Ich denke jeden Tag <b>an</b> unsere Zeit in Wien. <b>Geht es</b> dir gut?</div>Dank für + 4격 · gefallen + 3격 mir · denken an + 4격이에요.<br>안부는 es geht + 3격 — Geht es dir gut?</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"04252ea27e\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mit ihr&quot;],[&quot;darüber&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Hast du schon mit Frau Weber über den Plan gesprochen? — Ja, ich habe gestern <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Frau Weber)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(den Plan)</span> gesprochen.</div><div class=\"qko\">베버 씨와 그 계획에 대해 벌써 이야기했어요? — 네, 어제 그분과 그것에 대해 이야기했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hast du schon mit Frau Weber über den Plan gesprochen? — Ja, ich habe gestern <b>mit ihr</b> <b>darüber</b> gesprochen.</div>사람(Frau Weber)은 전치사 + 대명사 — mit ihr.<br>사물(den Plan)은 da(r)- + 전치사 — darüber.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9d1a6964d4\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> Es spielen heute zwei Bands im Park. → heute를 맨 앞에 놓으면?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Heute spielen zwei Bands im Park.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Heute spielt zwei Bands im Park.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Heute spielen es zwei Bands im Park.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Heute spielt es zwei Bands im Park.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">이 es는 첫 자리만 채우는 es예요. 다른 말이 첫 자리에 오면 사라져요.<br>동사는 진짜 주어 zwei Bands(복수)에 맞춰 spielen이에요. 날씨의 es와 달라요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"70fa9aa1ba\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) Der Kuchen schmeckt den Kindern.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) Die Stiefel passen ihm nicht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) Meine Eltern fehlt mir sehr.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Mir tun die Füße weh.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">fehlen의 주어는 meine Eltern(복수)이라서 fehlen이어야 해요 — Meine Eltern fehlen mir sehr.<br>나머지는 사물 주어에 동사를 맞췄어요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"86589ef979\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;die&quot;],[&quot;um&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">32.</strong> Ich bitte <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Nachbarin · 여성)</span> Nachbarin <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> Hilfe.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 옆집 여자분께 도움을 부탁해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich bitte <b>die</b> Nachbarin <b>um</b> Hilfe.</div>bitten은 부탁받는 사람이 4격, 부탁하는 것이 um + 4격이에요.<br>한국어 '~께'를 보고 3격 der를 쓰지 않도록 해요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge plus-badge\">보강</span><span class=\"sub-title\">보강 문제 · 문장을 바꿔 쓰고, 틀린 단어를 찾아요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"d2a6046529\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir warten darauf.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">33.</strong> 사물을 da(r)-로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Wir warten auf das Paket.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 33\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir warten darauf.</b></div>모음으로 시작하는 전치사 앞에는 r이 들어가요. da + r + auf.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9df7c2e85f\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Woran denkt sie?&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">34.</strong> 굵은 글씨 부분을 묻는 질문으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Sie denkt an <strong>den Urlaub</strong>.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 34\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Woran denkt sie?</b></div>사물은 wo(r) + 전치사로 물어요. an → woran.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"31c671e6f5\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Er träumt von ihr.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">35.</strong> 사람을 전치사 + 대명사로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Er träumt von seiner Freundin.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 35\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Er träumt von ihr.</b></div>사람은 da(r)-가 아니라 전치사 + 인칭대명사로 받아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5dcd2d04bf\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"3\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">36.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 재킷은 마음에 안 들어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">Jacke</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">gefällt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">mich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">nicht.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Die Jacke gefällt mir nicht.</b></div>gefallen은 3격 동사예요. mir.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"13e11ade6a\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"3\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">37.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 미술에 관심이 있어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">interessiere</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">mich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">auf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Kunst.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Ich interessiere mich für Kunst.</b></div>sich interessieren은 für와 함께 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e705529d12\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"2\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">38.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 기차를 기다려요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">warten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">an</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Zug.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Wir warten auf den Zug.</